    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24357" root="صعق" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَعْقَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَاعِقَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also The <i>sound proceeding from a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَاعِقَة</span> [or <i>thunderbolt</i>]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الصَّعْقَةُ الأُولَى</span> means <i>The first blast</i> [<i>of the horn
on the day of resurrection</i>]. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَعْقَةٌ</span> also signifies <i>A death.</i> (TA.)

